{"schema":"s10y-choice-draft-v1","questions":[{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"确定各方程的次数，选择按 a 至 h 顺序列出的完整结果。\n\na) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；\nb) $5x-6y-14=0$；\nc) $x^3-5x^2y^4+y^5-8y^3=0$；\nd) $x^2-5x^3y+y^4-1=0$；\ne) $x-xy=65$；\nf) $x^4-8x^2y^3+y^4=16$；\ng) $3xy=x(y+1)-5y$；\nh) $7x^8-12xy+y=7x^2(x^6+1)$。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(2,1,5,4,1,4,1,8)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(2,1,6,4,2,5,2,8)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(2,1,6,4,2,5,2,2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(2,1,6,4,2,5,1,2)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"选择所有使方程 $x^2-y+2=0$ 成立的数对 $(x,y)$。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(1,3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(0,0)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-2,2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-1,-3)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $x-3y=1$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(4,1)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(-2,1)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(3,0)$ 和 $(4,1)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(0,1)$ 和 $(1,4)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $5x+y=2$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(0,2)$ 和 $(1,7)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(0,2)$ 和 $(1,-3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(2,0)$ 和 $(-3,1)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(0,10)$ 和 $(1,5)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $x-xy=15$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(15,0)$ 和 $(5,2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(15,0)$ 和 $(5,-2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(0,15)$ 和 $(-2,5)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(15,0)$ 和 $(14,1)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $x^2+3y=1$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(-1,\\frac23)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(-1,-\\frac23)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(-1,0)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(0,3)$ 和 $(1,0)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $(x-1)(y-2)=0$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(0,2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(1,0)$ 和 $(0,-2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(0,1)$ 和 $(2,0)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(1,2)$ 和 $(2,3)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于方程 $(x^2+1)(y-5)=0$，下列哪一组含有两个不同的实数解？数对按 $(x,y)$ 书写。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(0,4)$ 和 $(1,3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(0,5)$ 和 $(1,-5)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(5,0)$ 和 $(5,1)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(0,5)$ 和 $(1,5)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于实数方程 $(x+5)^2+(y-2)^2=-1$，下列关于解集的论断及其理由，哪一项正确？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"解集为空；两个平方均非负，和也非负，不可能等于 $-1$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"解集为 $\\{(-5,2)\\}$；两个平方同时取最小值 $0$ 就满足方程。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"解集为以 $(-5,2)$ 为圆心、半径为 $1$ 的圆周；平方和给出距离的平方。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"解集为 $\\{(-6,2),(-4,2)\\}$；令 $y=2$ 后得到 $x+5=\\pm1$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于实数方程 $(x-7)^2+(y+4)^2=0$，下列关于解集的论断及其理由，哪一项正确？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"解集为 $\\{(7,t):t\\in\\mathbb R\\}$；第一个平方为零就足以使和为零。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"解集为 $\\{(7,4)\\}$；两平方都为零要求 $x=7$ 且 $y=4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"解集为 $\\{(7,-4)\\}$；非负平方的和为零要求两项都为零，该数对也满足方程。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"解集为空；两个实数平方的和总是严格大于零，不能等于零。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"对于下列四个方程，哪一项依次描述了它们的完整图象？\n\na) $2x-3y=6$；\nb) $\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{y}{3}=1$；\nc) $x=-4$；\nd) $y=2$。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"a) 经过 $(3,0),(0,2)$ 的完整直线；b) 经过 $(2,0),(0,3)$ 的完整直线；c) 竖直直线 $x=-4$；d) 水平直线 $y=2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"a) 经过 $(3,0),(0,-2)$ 的完整直线；b) 经过 $(2,0),(0,3)$ 的完整直线；c) 竖直直线 $x=-4$；d) 水平直线 $y=2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"a) 经过 $(3,0),(0,-2)$ 的完整直线；b) 经过 $(2,0),(0,3)$ 的完整直线；c) 水平直线 $y=-4$；d) 竖直直线 $x=2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"a) 以 $(3,0),(0,-2)$ 为端点的线段；b) 以 $(2,0),(0,3)$ 为端点的线段；c) 竖直直线 $x=-4$；d) 水平直线 $y=2$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"方程 $(x-y)(x+y)=0$ 的完整图象是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"只有直线 $y=x$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"只有点 $(0,0)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"直线 $y=x$ 与直线 $y=-x$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"抛物线 $y=x^2$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"方程 $(x-3)(y+1)=0$ 的完整图象是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"只有点 $(3,-1)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"水平直线 $y=3$ 与竖直直线 $x=-1$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"竖直直线 $x=-3$ 与水平直线 $y=1$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"竖直直线 $x=3$ 与水平直线 $y=-1$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"比较 $y=\\frac6x$ 与 $xy=-12$ 的完整图象，哪一项描述正确？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"两者都是双曲线，两坐标轴都是渐近线且不属于图象；前者的两支在第一、第三象限，经过 $(2,3)$、$(-2,-3)$；后者在第二、第四象限，经过 $(3,-4)$、$(-3,4)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"两者都是双曲线，两坐标轴都是渐近线且不属于图象；前者的两支在第二、第四象限，经过 $(2,-3)$、$(-2,3)$；后者在第一、第三象限，经过 $(3,4)$、$(-3,-4)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"两者都只有双曲线的一支，两坐标轴都是渐近线且不属于图象；前者仅在第一象限，经过 $(2,3)$；后者仅在第四象限，经过 $(3,-4)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"两者都是双曲线，两坐标轴都是渐近线且不属于图象；前者的两支在第一、第三象限，经过 $(2,30)$、$(-2,-30)$；后者在第二、第四象限，经过 $(3,-40)$、$(-3,40)$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"下列方程的完整图象，按 a 至 f 顺序是哪一组？\n\na) $x^2+y^2=16$；\nb) $x^2+y^2=36$；\nc) $x^2+y^2=6\\frac14$；\nd) $x^2+y^2=20$；\ne) $x^2+y^2=12$；\nf) $x^2+y^2=0$。\n\n选项中列出的圆周，圆心均为坐标原点。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"a 至 e 分别为半径 $4,6,\\frac{25}{4},2\\sqrt5,2\\sqrt3$ 的圆周；f 只有点 $(0,0)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"a 至 e 分别为半径 $16,36,\\frac{25}{4},20,12$ 的圆周；f 只有点 $(0,0)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"a 至 e 分别为半径 $4,6,\\frac52,2\\sqrt5,2\\sqrt3$ 的圆周；f 只有点 $(0,0)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"a 至 e 分别为半径 $4,6,\\frac52,2\\sqrt5,2\\sqrt3$ 的圆周；f 的图象为空集。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"四个圆周的圆心均在坐标原点，半径依次为 $2$、$4.5$、$\\sqrt{13}$、$\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}$。哪一组方程按此顺序分别表示这四个圆周？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x^2+y^2=2$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac92$；$x^2+y^2=\\sqrt{13}$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x^2+y^2=4$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac{81}{4}$；$x^2+y^2=13$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac32$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x^2+y^2=4$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac{81}{4}$；$x^2+y^2=13$；$x^2+y^2=3$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x^2+y^2=4$；$x^2+y^2=\\frac{81}{2}$；$x^2+y^2=13$；$x^2+y^2=3$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"选择所有在圆周 $x^2+y^2=144$ 上的点。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$B(7,9)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$C(10,7)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$D(0,-12)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$E(-8,4\\sqrt5)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"两个圆周的圆心都在坐标原点，第一个经过 $M(5,12)$，第二个经过 $N(-1,-3)$。哪一项依次给出这两个圆周的方程？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x^2+y^2=13$；$x^2+y^2=\\sqrt{10}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x^2+y^2=17$；$x^2+y^2=-4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x^2+y^2=169$；$x^2+y^2=-10$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x^2+y^2=169$；$x^2+y^2=10$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"用变量 $y$ 表示方程 $2x+3y=7$ 中的变量 $x$。哪一项同时给出正确表达式及原方程允许的全部 $y$ 值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x=\\frac{7+3y}{2}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x=\\frac{7-3y}{2}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x=7-\\frac{3y}{2}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x=\\frac{7-2y}{3}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"用变量 $y$ 表示方程 $3x-5y=1$ 中的变量 $x$。哪一项同时给出正确表达式及原方程允许的全部 $y$ 值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x=\\frac{1+5y}{3}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x=\\frac{1-5y}{3}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x=\\frac{1+3y}{5}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x=1+\\frac{5y}{3}$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"用变量 $y$ 表示方程 $x+xy=10$ 中的变量 $x$。哪一项同时给出正确表达式及原方程允许的全部 $y$ 值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x=\\frac{10}{y}$，$y\\ne0$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x=10-y$，$y\\in\\mathbb R$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x=\\frac{10}{1+y}$，$y\\ne-1$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x=\\frac{10}{1+y}$，$y\\notin\\{-1,0\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"用变量 $y$ 表示方程 $xy-y^2-2x=1$ 中的变量 $x$。哪一项同时给出正确表达式及原方程允许的全部 $y$ 值？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x=\\frac{y^2+1}{y-2}$，$y\\ne2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x=\\frac{y^2-1}{y-2}$，$y\\ne2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x=\\frac{y^2+1}{y+2}$，$y\\ne-2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x=\\frac{y^2+1}{y-2}$，$y>2$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"化简 $\\frac{a^2+7a+6}{(a-3)^2-16}$，并保留原式的定义域。哪一项是完整结果？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\frac{a+6}{a-7}$，$a\\notin\\{-1,7\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\frac{a+6}{a-7}$，$a\\ne7$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{a+6}{a+7}$，$a\\notin\\{-1,-7\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\frac{a+1}{a-7}$，$a\\notin\\{-1,7\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"化简 $\\frac{4b^2-7b-2}{81(b+7)^2}$，并保留原式的定义域。哪一项是完整结果？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\frac{(4b-1)(b+2)}{81(b+7)^2}$，$b\\ne-7$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\frac{(4b+1)(b-2)}{81(b+7)^2}$，$b\\ne-7$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{(4b+1)(b-2)}{9(b+7)^2}$，$b\\ne-7$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\frac{(4b+1)(b-2)}{81(b+7)}$，$b\\ne-7$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"不等式 $P^2-10P+21<0$ 的完整实数解集是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-\\infty,3)\\cup(7,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$[3,7]$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(3,7)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-7,-3)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"不等式 $u^2-8u+16>0$ 的完整实数解集是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\varnothing$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\mathbb R$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(4,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-\\infty,4)\\cup(4,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"不等式 $q^2+6q+13>0$ 的完整实数解集是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\mathbb R$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\varnothing$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\infty,-3)\\cup(-3,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-3,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"不等式 $-m^2-2m-3>0$ 的完整实数解集是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\mathbb R$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\varnothing$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\infty,-1)\\cup(-1,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-\\infty,-1)$","figure_ids":[]}]}}],"new_figures":[]}
